    "OpenCode gets the system prompt as the agent %@. The app creates it at launch and before each summary and overwrites manual changes. Set up a custom agent under a different name." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "OpenCode dostane systémový prompt ako agenta %@. Aplikácia ho vytvorí pri štarte a pred každým zápisom a ručné zmeny prepíše. Vlastného agenta nastavte pod iným menom."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OpenCode gives the summary agent more permissions than the app allows (%@). Check your OpenCode version and configuration." : {
      "localizations" : {
